    "text": "Two loudspeakers are being compared. One is perceived to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn></math> times louder than the other. The difference in intensity levels between the two, when measured in decibels, is"
